Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Fourth Episode\NThe Snow Eagle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s your turn, doctor.\NYour knight is in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so watch out for the next move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you to play, doctor.\NToday you're a bit distracted!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me!\NLet me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Yes, it seems to me\Nthat you've made a good move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- There! What do you think?\N- Not bad! Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And after this other move, what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Nwith the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He always likes\Nplaying chess so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.82,0:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But today he is so distracted!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Doctor!\N- It's my turn, good! So... There!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, perhaps it’s\Nbetter to stop playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is something\Nworrying you, please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, it’s really a silly thing,\Nbut I can't stop thinking about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s snowing a lot! They say it hasn't\Nsnowed this much in a hundred years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It has already been\Nsnowing for five days straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a legend about an eagle, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- An eagle?\N- It is said that the snow eagle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...it brings a bad omen,\Nif it appears after a snowfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The snow eagle\Nthat brings a bad omen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!\NIt arrives after a heavy snowfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it covers the country\Nwith its great wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it is a harbinger\Nof some great misfortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were worried about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it is nothing more\Nthan a legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! But old legends always\Nhave a foundation of truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And this scares me a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, every time\Na misfortune occurred,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,there has always been\Na premonitory sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, the snow eagle...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...that brings the bad omen\Nhas already appeared as I feared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See? What did I tell you?\NHere is the symbol of the bad omen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I was struck\Nmuch more...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...by the sound we heard\Nlast night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, why don't you come down?\NSo we can make a snowman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Tink, I'm coming down!\NI'll be down in a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already finished, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what do you think\Nof my snowman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad!\NBut who is it supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange that you don't\Nrecognize the Masked Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't be like that!\N- The Masked Knight isn't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taller, more elegant, thinner!\NAnd besides, he's more handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours! It's Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here he comes!\N- What?! Franz?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come sooner because\Nof the snowfall. Hi, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am glad you came!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NCan you show it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can play with you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We were making snowmen.\NLook, that one is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- But it's me!\N- Do you recognize yourself in that snowman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly!\NYou made it look just like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will make\Na snowman that looks like you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd better\Nleave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.82,0:05:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful! It's like being\Nin Heaven again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a garden\Nof white flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh..! I heard a noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to recover, old man!\NCome on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me what happened, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- He has regained consciousness!\N- You are a citizen of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to the castle,\NI must warn the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X is coming\Nwith a terrible weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your snowman\Nis much more beautiful than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, yours is much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, in reality I didn't\Nonly come here to play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to discover the origin\Nof this mysterious sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire... Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X has reached
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...bringing with it\Na terrible weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it is a horrible weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The border guards\Nhave all been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, that sound could\Ncome from Union X's weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to explore the forest\Nof orange trees, will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, show me the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!\NHow will you get there without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, are you sure\Nit’s right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! I’m sure\Nthis is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s completely\Ndeserted! Not a soul in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, I have the feeling\Nthat someone is watching us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, to tell you the\Ntruth, I have the same feeling too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Come out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the patrol squad\Nof Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You won’t leave here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Yes, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll tear you to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we've put them to flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't claim victory yet! You're in for something very interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you! You can't imagine the end that awaits you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what we should expect, but I'm not afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Here I am, Franz, I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes! Everything's fine!\N- Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The eagle of ill omen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Franz, we're coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Load!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our cannon will reduce Silverland Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...to a pile of ruins!\NLet's move forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going like this!\NSet course for Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So that noise was the roar of the cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A disaster will happen if that big cannon crosses the border!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We must prevent it at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! We will prevent it! That weapon will not enter Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire, do you have any good ideas?\N- Yes! Look down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We will collapse the bridge over the river that marks the border!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, they didn't\Ndestroy the guard post.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some\Ngunpowder there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That seems like a good\Nidea! We'll blow up the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What will we do if those\Nsoldiers try to occupy the Fortress?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do everything to defeat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's about to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, we've beaten\Nthem all, you can come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Here are the\Nbarrels of gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be enough. The\Nproblem is how to transport it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea!\NWe'll build a sled...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we will bring\Nyou the gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, gallop, little horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Like that! Hurray! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Tink, or you'll\Nbe thrown to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's catch up to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Union squad!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are they already chasing us?\N- Come on! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Sapphire!\NThe soldiers have skis...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...with sharp points!\N- Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! The sled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's happening, Sapphire?\N- They've detached the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- We'll have to steer the sled ourselves!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire and Tink are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to crash into the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink, is everything okay?\N- Yes, everything's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm afraid these soldiers\Nare too many for you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, all the gunpowder\Nhas fallen into the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more to be done!\NSo for now let's go back to the Fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dammit! - They hit her!\N- Yes, they hit her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- By now it's been razed to the ground!\N- We must hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a gorge further ahead,\Nwe can hide there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How come my glove\Ngot scorched?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! That icicle acted\Nas a lens and burned the glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a lens!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an idea! If we used\Nthe icicles as lenses...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This gorge is not big and one can\Neasily trigger an avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, perhaps, we can block\Nthat big cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily the sun is still high!\NMaybe we'll succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we have to look\Nfor a piece of ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- As big as possible!\N- All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We must hurry\Nor we won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd easily find\Npieces of ice in so much snow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I don't see\Neven one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what Sapphire wants\Nto do with the ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.02,0:19:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! I'm slipping!\NSapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you finished yet?\NThe ice is heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Tink,\Ntry to hold on a little longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost finished. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a danger of avalanches\Nhere; if we make noise, they will bury us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out that fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:20:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally understand!\N- You want to blow up the cannon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...with the ice lens!\N- Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we have the\Nsun on our side...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We must try!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine on our glories, sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Celebrate the invasion of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how powerful\Nwe are with our weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X will conquer the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will see our banners\Non every continent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! I missed my aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, we must immediately\Ndirect the beam onto the fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We are being attacked from above!\NArchers, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Franz!\NDon't expose yourself too much! Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! But you be careful\Nof the arrows too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:21:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn,\Nthey grazed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The fuse will catch fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The avalanche!\NThe avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.82,0:22:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Tink!\NHold on tight to the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz, how are you?\N- Fine. And you, are you safe and sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.66,0:23:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Everything is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what became\Nof the cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray, we have destroyed\NUnion X!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.02,0:23:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The cannon by now\Nis buried forever under the snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.14,0:23:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the sun is melting\Nthe snow eagle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Union can rise again,\Nso we must be ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...to defend ourselves\Nat any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.26,0:24:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Franz, we must maintain\Npeace at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.18,0:24:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And so we will have to be\Nalways united to defend it.
